   "ruling": "Ruling: finding; i1040sb p. 3, Line 8, 'During 2025, did you receive a distribution from, or were you the grantor of, or transferor to, a foreign trust?' and 'a loan of cash or marketable securities is generally considered to be a distribution'. The reviewer finds the foreign-trust test in agreement with cfr-26-301-7701-7 and is right that the given pages support neither the indirect receipt ('through another person or company'), nor the free or below-market use of trust property, nor 'a foreign foundation, a waqf or another arrangement' counting as a trust. These follow the Form 3520 rules, which are not archived or cited; each only widens a Yes, which refuses (Form 3520), so no value is wrong and no refusal is missed. Low (BUG-0759): archive i3520 and cite the passages, or drop a clause they do not support.",
